      "rubric": "SQL notes + RLS + trigger benar dan teruji 2 akun (20%), Lapisan data remote/local/repository + fallback offline (25%), NotesProvider: search, filter, optimistic delete + rollback (15%), UI: list, refresh, empty/error/loading, Dismissible, form tambah/edit (20%), Unit test lulus (10%), Fitur pengembangan + laporan (10%)."
